---
description: Prefer the vexus MCP tools for code navigation
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo has a vexus code index (semantic + call graph) exposed as MCP tools.
Before grep/file-scanning: `explore` answers "how/where/what-calls" questions in
one call with verbatim source; `search` finds symbols by meaning; `open` fetches
exact code; `callers`/`callees`/`impact` trace relationships; `status` shows
index health. Grep is for exact strings, comments, config values, generated files.
